                                    <asp:Label ID="lblUpdate" runat="server" Width="377px"><ul><li>
                        	Event details, Results and Accomplishments can be updated using the edit icon in the Event home page or from the Search page. </li> 
	<li>If you have chosen an option of “Date unsure” to specify Event Date earlier and want to specify the exact date  now  you can do that by entering the Event Date in Event Occurred Date field.
	<li>While updating the event details you can add a new recorder name, change the existing recorder name, add a new actor to the event or change the actor. </li>
	<li>You can also edit the event location information by changing the Country, State where the event is scheduled to occur or occurred.</li>
	<li>You can change the Event occurring period, item novelty, and Item type.</li>
	<li>You can update or change the Item Description, Item Meaning and Item Result.</li>
	<li>Event type, Event goal and Event communication can also be changed
</li></ul>


